--- !u!114 &1433215839
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1433215837}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 108eca4d29993694286283626aaf092e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueTrigger
  dialogue:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: Tiziano Buccina
        portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 59b9bc854a770a244bf250243c77f3b9, type: 3}
      line: We meet again, old man...
    - character:
        name: Cornelius Batter
        portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0d67f248ad53d584084ea9ee45821472, type: 3}
      line: "Indeed, we do, would love to say that it\u2019s a pleasure, but I can
        tell that you aint coming to recover your spot in the band."
    - character:
        name: Tiziano Buccina
        portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 59b9bc854a770a244bf250243c77f3b9, type: 3}
      line: "I can see that despite that trunk of yours which you refer to as head
        isn\u2019t hollow after all."
    - character:
        name: Cornelius Batter
        portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0d67f248ad53d584084ea9ee45821472, type: 3}
      line: You seem to be pretty full too.
    - character:
        name: Tiziano Buccina
        portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 59b9bc854a770a244bf250243c77f3b9, type: 3}
      line: Of desires to be the greatest I can by myself, without needing others
        to rely on for my lack of talent, as you.
    - character:
        name: Cornelius Batter
        portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0d67f248ad53d584084ea9ee45821472, type: 3}
      line: Lone hunters like you become easy preys when the flock groups up.
    - character:
        name: Tiziano Buccina
        portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 59b9bc854a770a244bf250243c77f3b9, type: 3}
      line: Pathetic that you compare yourself with a mere sheep, shows your weakness
        and that I showed up at the right time.
    - character:
        name: Tiziano Buccina
        portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 59b9bc854a770a244bf250243c77f3b9, type: 3}
      line: "But anyways I don\u2019t want to talk until both of us rot, come at
        me fossil!"
    - character:
        name: Cornelius Batter
        portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0d67f248ad53d584084ea9ee45821472, type: 3}
      line: "If it depended on your ability to move I\u2019d be waiting here for
        a while anyways... "
    - character:
        name: Cornelius Batter
        portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0d67f248ad53d584084ea9ee45821472, type: 3}
      line: You seem to be pretty full too.
